# A `test` across a ring of three modules, panel 252's R1 (2026-11-19): the
# program prints the walk round the ring, and `heroes test`, which the run
# form asks of a case whose program holds a `test`, runs this file's test and
# `rb`'s, each calling round the ring.
use ra

function main()
    print(ra.start(n: 5))

test "the walk round the ring from the program's own file"
    assert ra.start(n: 1) == 4
